+# Version Scheme
+
+This project uses Semantic Versioning (Semver), in the major.minor.patch format, as its version numbering scheme. It was chosen because Semver gives package consumers clearer expectations: the version number signals breaking changes, new features, and fixes, and so communicates compatibility guarantees to downstream users.
